window.EN={"1":"Something seems off. Did something happen outside?","2":"It seems someone has gotten into the mansion. Could be an army.","3":"The Empire's security force... What happened to Salem?","4":"He may have been taken down... I'll go take a look. You wait here.","5":"What's wrong? ...Did something happen?","6":"An army's come to catch us... Damn it, those annoying bastards!","7":"An army...","8":"You smiled just now. Oho, did you think you could get away from me?","9":"Fool, not a chance. Someone as handy as you, I'm never letting go.","10":"Why... why do you do such awful things... Please let me go, I'm begging you.","11":"I said no.","12":"Try anything stupid like running away, and I'll put you through something awful like before. You want that!?","13":"No!! Anything but that!! I'm sorry, please forgive me!","14":"Heh, as long as you understand.","15":"Now back Troude up with that Thief staff! Come on, come on, hurry up, you slowpoke!","16":"I will persuade Perne. He's a man who understands if you talk to him.","17":"Salem, you'll help us?","18":"I still don't really understand, but... for now there's nothing else for it...","19":"What's wrong, Lifis? You look pale.","20":"Prince, I, uh, this place is a bit... Sorry, but couldn't you pick someone else?","21":"...Come to think of it, you said you lived around here as a child. Do you know someone among the thieves?","22":"No, well, uh... There's a guy I'm not good with, so...","23":"As if that were a reason. Get to your position quickly!","24":"Please! Just this once, let me off!","25":"That won't do. It is the prince's order!","26":"Um...","27":"Lara? What is it?","28":"Perne isn't a bad person.","29":"Do you know him, Lara?","30":"Yes... I... until a year ago I was a dancer in a troupe of traveling performers.","31":"Every day was unbearably hard, but I'd been sold for money when I was little, so I couldn't even run away...","32":"The one who rescued me from that was Perne.","33":"Is that so. So that's how you became a thief...","34":"Lord Leif, please let me talk to him. I... I want to talk to Perne!","35":"Perne, stop this now!","36":"Salem!? Why are you in among the enemy?","37":"Don't tell me you sold us out.","38":"Don't be absurd. These people are not enemies. They are Prince Leif's Liberation Army.","39":"\"Liberation Army\"? What's that?","40":"People who share our ideals. I'll explain later. For now, just put away your sword!","41":"Hmm... I don't really get it, but basically you're saying stop fighting.","42":"...It's you saying it. You must've thought it through deeply.","43":"All right, I'll trust you. Do whatever you like.","44":"Troude is still fighting. He only listens to what you say. Won't you persuade him?","45":"Sure. He's a valuable comrade. I can't have him dying on me.","46":"Tch, this is bad!","47":"What? ...Are you Lifis? ...Hey, long time no see!","48":"L-long time no see... Mr.... Perne...","49":"You haven't changed a bit. Just like when you were a brat. Did you ever get over wetting yourself?","50":"P-please stop. That's ancient history!","51":"Is it? Man, you were the biggest crybaby in the village,","52":"and it feels like only yesterday that all kinds of guys were bullying you to no end.","53":"...The one who bullied me first and foremost was you, Mr. Perne...","54":"Hm? You say something?","55":"No, it's nothing...","56":"Right. So, this place you're working, is this that Liberation Army I've heard rumors about?","57":"Looks pretty interesting. Yeah, I like it. Introduce me to your leader.","58":"Whaat!","59":"What! You got a problem with that?","60":"...No...","61":"From now on let's get along just like old times, eh!","62":"Ugh... Stuck with this bastard again...","63":"What's with you? You look pale.","64":"Huh? D-d-do I? M-m-maybe I caught a cold? Aha, aha, ahaha...","65":"?","66":"More importantly, Mr. Perne, please do something about that mercenary. Nobody can handle him and it's a real problem.","67":"Hm? You mean Troude? Leave it to me. He's a valuable comrade. I can't have him dying on me.","68":"Hey, Troude. That's enough. Put away your sword.","69":"Hm? ...What do you mean?","70":"I'm joining the Liberation Army. You help out too.","71":"I see... so these are the Liberation Army... I thought their morale was too high for imperial troops; that explains it.","72":"Well, all right. Sounds interesting.","73":"Good, glad to hear it. You and I go way back. I didn't want to make trouble with you.","74":"Well, I'll be counting on you from here on too.","75":"Heh, leave it to me.","76":"Tina!? What are you doing in a place like this!!","77":"Oh, big sister Safy!! Waaah...","78":"I can't understand if you're crying! What on earth happened? Why did you leave Tahra?","79":"I wanted to help you, big sis, so I left the city...","80":"And then I got caught by a thief called Perne, and m-made a slave...","81":"A slave!? It can't be!? What on earth did he do to you?","82":"He told me to help with thieving... You know, since I can use the Thief and Unlock staves.","83":"Why didn't you refuse?","84":"I said I didn't want to. And then, he does awful things.","85":"Awful things!?","86":"Yeah...","87":"Tina! Say it clearly. Depending on what it is, I too am prepared to act!","88":"That guy... he dangles caterpillars, which I hate, in front of my face, and puts them on top of my head.","89":"It was so, so scary, I really thought I'd die.","90":"...Is that all?","91":"Yeah... But it was really scary. Even now just remembering gives me chills.","92":"Tina...","93":"Yes?","94":"I told you to wait in Tahra until I got back, didn't I?","95":"This is what happens when you don't do as I say. Reflect on it.","96":"Okay, I'm sorry... But hey, big sis, Lord Leif is so cool, isn't he!","97":"Someone like the prince is my ideal. Hey, hey, what do you think, big sis?","98":"Tina... I... seem to be a little tired. Let's talk again later.","99":"Okaaay, big sister Safy!","100":"Perne!","101":"Hm? If it isn't Lara... What are you doing here?","102":"Oho... So you missed me and came back, is that it?","103":"If I said yes, would you be happy?","104":"Hey, hey, what are you saying with that serious face?","105":"I've got no use for a kid like you. Hurry on back to Munster.","106":"You say that and drive me away again. Back when I was dancing, I thought you liked me, Perne.","107":"I mean, you came to watch so eagerly.","108":"Yeah, back then I didn't know you were such a kid.","109":"That's right. I liked your dancing.","110":"It's like, strength wells up in your body, or... it gives you a strange feeling.","111":"But it was hard on you, right? It's good that you quit.","112":"Yeah... But I don't dislike dancing.","113":"So... if that's what you want, Perne, I don't mind going back to being a dancer.","114":"Don't be stupid...","115":"It's not only for you, Perne.","116":"If my dancing can cheer everyone up even a little, I thought that might be nice too...","117":"Who's \"everyone\"?","118":"Prince Leif's Liberation Army of northern Thracia. I'm helping out too. Not that I'm much use.","119":"Hmm... I see. So that's how it is...","120":"All right, Lara, go back to being a dancer. Do that, and I'll join the Liberation Army.","121":"Really, Perne!? I can believe you!","122":"Yeah. I can't be a thief of Dakia forever, either.","123":"The liberation of northern Thracia, huh... This looks like it'll get interesting.","124":"Now, day has broken. The soldiers are well rested. Let us set out for Tahra!","125":"Hey, release Troude, the one you've got captive.","126":"He's a valuable comrade of mine. I'll have Troude join the Liberation Army too. No problem with that, right?","127":"I see. You care about your friends, Perne.","128":"The prince doesn't know what this bastard is really like... This is dangerous, dangerous...","129":"Hmph, you fools. Don't think the great Perne is just some thief!","130":"Tch... What a mess...","131":"Hmph. You think you've done me a favor? Don't underestimate the great Perne!","132":"This is the end. Die!","133":"Kh... For me, of all people...","134":"I won't thank you. Next time we meet, I'll kill you!","135":"Big sister Safy... help me...","136":"Big sis... I'm sorry...","137":"Thank you for sparing me. I'm going to look for big sister Safy."};
